# Compact UI controls (mandatory)

Use the same compact control language **everywhere** in this app. Do not invent larger tables, inputs, or buttons on new screens.

## Page shell (fixed width, centered)

- Wrap list/admin page roots in a class registered in [`tokens.scss`](frontend/src/styles/tokens.scss) shared shell (`.pmf-page`, `.rc-users`, `.rc-wc`, `.rc-org`, …).
- Content uses `max-width: var(--pmf-page-max)` with `margin-left/right: auto` and horizontal pad — **do not** let new pages stretch edge-to-edge past the shell.
- When adding a new page class (e.g. `.rc-foo`), add it to both shell selector groups in `tokens.scss`.

## Tables

- Prefer shared [`TableComponent`](frontend/src/components/TableComponent.jsx) for list pages.
- Default table size is **`small`** (do not pass `size="large"` / oversized Prime DataTables).
- Row action buttons: rounded, ~2rem, `size="small"` / text icons via `TableActions`.

## Buttons & inputs

- Prefer `size="small"` on PrimeReact `Button`. Avoid `size="large"`.
- Prefer `SafeInputText` / `SafeInputTextarea` for text fields.
- Form labels and dialog body: ~`0.8–0.875rem`; table body ~`0.85–0.9rem`.
- Dialog footers: small outlined Cancel + small primary action; tight gap.
- Tab toolbars (search + primary Add): same row as tabs, tools on the **far right** (see Work centres / Org).

## Dialogs & nested editors

- Confirm: `p-button-sm` / `p-confirm-dialog-sm`; short copy.
- Instruction / note editors: compact title, hint, textarea, small footer.
- OARC / IED dialogs: inherit `.om-input` / `.pmf-compact` sizing — no oversized Prime defaults inside tables.

## Anti-patterns

- Full-bleed content that ignores `--pmf-page-max`.
- Full-width hero inputs inside data tables.
- Mixing a one-off “big” DataTable style on a single page.
- Rebuilding table chrome instead of `TableComponent` when a standard list will do.
- Putting Add / Search on a separate row below tabs when peers use the tabs-tools row.
